<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 2.6 pct in April.</title>
<headline>Malaysia year-on-year CPI up 2.6 pct in April.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's Consumer Price Index (CPI) for April rose 2.6 percent from the same month a year ago, the Statistics Department said on Friday.</p>
<p>The department previously reported that the CPI grew 3.2 percent year-on-year in March.  </p>
<p> CONSUMER PRICE INDEX     April 97   March 97  April 96</p>
<p> Change year/year pct	2.6	 3.2	 3.6</p>
<p> Index (base year 1994)   109.1	109.3     106.3</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
